      "text": [
        "3638 - وَ قَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : \"بَاشِرْ كِبَارَ أُمُورِكَ بِنَفْسِكَ وَ كِلْ مَا صَغُرَ مِنْهَا إِلَى غَيْرِكَ \" فَقِيلَ ضَرْبُ أَيِّ شَيْءٍ فَقَالَ \"ضَرْبُ أَشْرِيَةِ اَلْعَقَارِ وَ مَا أَشْبَهَهَا\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3638 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"Handle your major affairs personally, and delegate the smaller ones to others.\"\nIt was asked: \"What kind of tasks are you referring to?\"\nImam (as) replied: \"Matters like buying and selling properties and similar transactions.\""
        ]
      }
